      "id": 1,
      "text": "Burkburnett earned its name when Theodore Roosevelt, at a wolf hunt hosted by Samuel Burnett, suggested combining the rancher's name with his own.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
